{"name": "Pattern Ring", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"617\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/559dd5a12050865a905f96d70203ddc5.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pattern Ring is a roguelike alignment deck builder. Where you align your runes to cast spells in order to defeat enemies. Build your deck and craft your spells to meet the challenges ahead. Feed and grow your companion to aid in battle. Before it's too late, journey to the center of the maze and restore the Pattern Ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/9dc73e1bf638e8eb6aae88da9e28e2c9.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/ca227d426d76132870352c27f7537c50.poster.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/ca227d426d76132870352c27f7537c50.webm?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/ca227d426d76132870352c27f7537c50.mp4?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Pattern Ring, spell cards are fueled by runes. Aligning your runes in just the right pattern ignites the power of the cards. If you build your deck around your favorite rune patterns, you can play every card in your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/0a90dece18cc9b55ba7ef9d290fac851.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/fc1e6fd67ade33b600e0850cd3a27f9f.poster.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/fc1e6fd67ade33b600e0850cd3a27f9f.webm?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/fc1e6fd67ade33b600e0850cd3a27f9f.mp4?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck by purchasing powerful spell cards with gold! Gold can be collected along your route in the maze-like map or by defeating enemies you encounter along the way. You get an opportunity to shop after each battle, but be on the lookout, there are also hidden shops throughout the maze!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/d801102e7a216a142fa4685a83c385e5.poster.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/d801102e7a216a142fa4685a83c385e5.webm?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/d801102e7a216a142fa4685a83c385e5.mp4?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your deck by finding anvils of power which are hidden throughout the maze. Each type of anvil has a distinct ability to augment your spell cards, allowing you to unlock epic synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/c0a2aca7f2203871634d9cc257b8c4dd.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/6d12913e8b373246a741113146b786f9.poster.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/6d12913e8b373246a741113146b786f9.webm?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/6d12913e8b373246a741113146b786f9.mp4?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcky is your loyally devoted companion whose mission is to aid you on your journey to the center of the Ring.\u00a0He's also a hungry little guy! So, feeding him leftover runes will fill his belly and encourage him to follow your commands in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/2c6aaa0b8ef7b45df994e4436dfaacfe.poster.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/2c6aaa0b8ef7b45df994e4436dfaacfe.webm?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/2c6aaa0b8ef7b45df994e4436dfaacfe.mp4?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your little arc will grow alongside you as he gains experience through combat. As he levels up, he'll even learn new tricks! Train your Arcky to become the perfect sidekick. Good boy Arcky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/fc52174e290d26b6349db5044542e2b1.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/015f469812e4b7c0d2638f3920758ff8.poster.avif?t=1786214084\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/015f469812e4b7c0d2638f3920758ff8.webm?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/extras/015f469812e4b7c0d2638f3920758ff8.mp4?t=1786214084\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore our one-of-a-kind, maze-inspired map as you journey to the center. Each step reveals hidden enemies and special events that will challenge you and Arcky. Stay on track and make good time or veer off-course and discover the secrets of the maze. Don't take too long or the Ring will close on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A roguelike alignment deck builder. Where you align your runes to cast spells to defeat enemies. Build your deck and craft your spells to meet the challenges ahead. Feed and grow your companion to aid in battle. Before it's too late, journey to the center of the maze and restore the Pattern Ring.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925350/ee92fc6bd1a255db558a2e9f1ecfbb0e7d569a62/header.jpg?t=1786214084", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Strategy", "Card Game", "Card Battler", "Roguelike", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "Bendisi", "publishers": "Bendisi", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3925350", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ihgaVHduRjI", "first_seen": 1777672800.0, "review_rank": 738}